# CODEOWNERS
# Each module path maps to teams or individuals responsible for reviews.
# Lines are matched in order; the last matching rule wins.
# Format: <pattern>    @owner-or-team

# Global fallback - all files
*                                            @project-team

# Python FastAPI backend
/backend/                                    @project-team

# React frontend
/frontend/                                   @project-team

# Infrastructure
/infra/                                      @project-team
/scripts/                                    @project-team

# Documentation
/docs/                                       @project-team

# Deployment and infrastructure
/docker-compose.yml                          @project-team

# Security-sensitive files - require security review on any change
**/security/**                               @project-security-team
**/*ssl*                                     @project-security-team
**/*tls*                                     @project-security-team
**/*keystore*                                @project-security-team
**/*truststore*                              @project-security-team
**/SecurityConfig*                           @project-security-team

# AI and agent configuration - changes affect all agents
/.github/constitution.md                     @project-team
/.github/copilot-instructions.md             @project-team
/.github/agents/                             @project-team
/.github/instructions/                       @project-team
/.github/personas/                           @project-team
/.github/skills/                             @project-team
